{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02439",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.58,
      "end_seconds": 4.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Hello, sorry about the delay, do sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.67,
      "end_seconds": 5.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "Hello, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.76,
      "end_seconds": 9.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Have you been waiting long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.91,
      "end_seconds": 13.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Only about ten minutes, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.14,
      "end_seconds": 18.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Alright, tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.15,
      "end_seconds": 21.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "So, I've been sweating, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.66,
      "end_seconds": 29.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.28,
      "end_seconds": 37.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "I'd say two months. Actually, no, closer to about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.6,
      "end_seconds": 46.59,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.41,
      "end_seconds": 59.45,
      "duration_seconds": 12.04,
      "text": "Severe, really. I'd say a few times a day. Hmm, there's a pounding heart as well. About pounding heart, honestly, on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.36,
      "end_seconds": 63.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.9,
      "end_seconds": 68.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "I had my septum straightened in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.34,
      "end_seconds": 72.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Okay, do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.62,
      "end_seconds": 77.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.81,
      "end_seconds": 81.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.97,
      "end_seconds": 86.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.54,
      "end_seconds": 88.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.68,
      "end_seconds": 94.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.35,
      "end_seconds": 100.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.79,
      "end_seconds": 104.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.74,
      "end_seconds": 115.02,
      "duration_seconds": 9.28,
      "text": "I follow. Okay, I can see high blood pressure in your file as well. Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.03,
      "end_seconds": 120.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "My mother has an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.66,
      "end_seconds": 133.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.93,
      "end_seconds": 138.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "I take losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.77,
      "end_seconds": 144.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.36,
      "end_seconds": 146.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.3,
      "end_seconds": 169.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever, wheeze or calf pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.04,
      "end_seconds": 175.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "No fever, wheeze or calf pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.65,
      "end_seconds": 178.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.65,
      "end_seconds": 183.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.94,
      "end_seconds": 188.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.97,
      "end_seconds": 191.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.41,
      "end_seconds": 194.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.28,
      "end_seconds": 206.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.96,
      "end_seconds": 230.94,
      "duration_seconds": 9.98,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 94 percent, temperature 37.3, respiratory rate 20. And pulse is 103 beats a minute, pressure 132 over 76."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.44,
      "end_seconds": 236.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.25,
      "end_seconds": 239.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.74,
      "end_seconds": 252.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "There are crackles all the way up both lungs and you are breathing very fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.23,
      "end_seconds": 257.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.94,
      "end_seconds": 285.75,
      "duration_seconds": 9.81,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it fits best with acute pulmonary oedema. I want blood tests done, that's for pulmonary oedema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.67,
      "end_seconds": 293.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "How long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.99,
      "end_seconds": 298.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "I want a chest X-ray done, that's for pulmonary oedema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.47,
      "end_seconds": 300.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.98,
      "end_seconds": 322.36,
      "duration_seconds": 20.38,
      "text": "What I'm giving you is furosemide, 40 milligrams, once now, single dose. It's for fluid on the lungs. Sit upright, I am giving oxygen and a water tablet injection now. We'll catch up straight away. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.82,
      "end_seconds": 326.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.65,
      "end_seconds": 328.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}